    "text": "SALES CONTRACT 销售合同\nContract No. 合同编号：________________________\nDate 签订日期：________________________\nPlace of Signing 签订地点：________________________\nThe Seller 卖方：\nName 公司名称：________________________\nAddress 地址：________________________\nTel 电话：________________________  Fax 传真：________________________\nBank & Account 开户银行及账号：________________________\nThe Buyer 买方：\nName 公司名称：________________________\nAddress 地址：________________________\nTel 电话：________________________  Fax 传真：________________________\nBank & Account 开户银行及账号：________________________\nThe Seller agrees to sell and the Buyer agrees to buy the under-mentioned goods on the terms and conditions stated below. 买卖双方同意按下列条款由卖方出售、买方购进下列货物：\nNo.序号\nDescription & Specification货物名称及规格\nUnit单位\nQuantity数量\nUnit Price (USD)单价（美元）\nAmount (USD)总金额（美元）\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nTotal Amount 总金额\n\nTotal Amount in Words 总金额大写：________________________\n1. Terms of Trade 贸易术语：________________________ (FOB/CIF/CFR 等)\n2. Port of Loading 起运港：________________________\n3. Port of Destination 目的港：________________________\n4. Time of Shipment 装运期：________________________\n5. Packing 包装：________________________\n6. Payment Terms 付款方式：\n□ T/T (Telegraphic Transfer) 电汇：________________________\n□ L/C (Letter of Credit) 信用证：________________________\n□ Other 其他：________________________\n7. Insurance 保险：\nTo be covered by the □ Seller / □ Buyer for 110% of total invoice value against all risks and war risk. 由□卖方/□买方按发票金额110%投保一切险及战争险。\n8. Quality & Quantity Discrepancy 质量数量异议：\nIn case of quality discrepancy, claim shall be filed by the Buyer within 30 days after arrival of goods at destination port. For quantity discrepancy, claim shall be filed within 15 days after arrival of goods. 如货物质量不符，买方须在货物抵达目的港后30天内提出索赔；数量不符须在15天内提出索赔。\n9. Force Majeure 不可抗力：\nNeither party shall be responsible for failure or delay of performance of this contract due to force majeure incidents in accordance with international trade practices. 因不可抗力导致本合同无法履行或延迟履行，双方根据国际贸易惯例互不追责。\n10. Arbitration 仲裁：\nAll disputes arising from this contract shall be settled through friendly negotiation. If no settlement can be reached, the case shall be submitted to arbitration. 凡因本合同产生的一切争议，双方友好协商解决；协商不成，提交仲裁解决。\n11. Other Terms 其他条款：________________________\n12. Validity 合同生效：\nThis contract is made in duplicate, one copy for each party, and shall take effect upon signature and seal by both parties. 本合同一式两份，甲乙双方各执一份，双方签字盖章后生效。\n\n\n\nThe Seller 卖方（签字盖章）：________________________\nDate 日期：________________________\n\n\nThe Buyer 买方（签字盖章）：________________________\nDate 日期：________________________\n"
