    "text": "【Sales Contract 销售合同】\nSales Contract 销售合同 SALES CONTRACT — Fill-in Checklist 待填信息清单,,\nNo. 序号,Field to Fill 待填项目,Notes / Example 填写说明 / 示例\n1,Contract No. 合同编号,\n2,Date 签订日期,\n3,Place of Signing 签订地点,\n4,Seller Name 卖方名称,\n5,Seller Address 卖方地址,\n6,Seller Tel / Fax 卖方电话/传真,\n7,Seller Bank & Account 卖方开户银行及账号,\n8,Buyer Name 买方名称,\n9,Buyer Address 买方地址,\n10,Buyer Tel / Fax 买方电话/传真,\n11,Buyer Bank & Account 买方开户银行及账号,\n12,Goods Table 货物明细表,\"Per line: No., Description & Specification, Unit, Quantity, Unit Price (USD), Amount (USD) / 每行：序号、货物名称及规格、单位、数量、单价(USD)、总金额(USD)\"\n13,Total Amount 总金额,\n14,Total Amount in Words 总金额大写,\n15,Terms of Trade 贸易术语,\"FOB / CIF / CFR, etc. 等\"\n16,Port of Loading 起运港,\n17,Port of Destination 目的港,\n18,Time of Shipment 装运期,\n19,Packing 包装,\n20,Payment Terms 付款方式,Tick: T/T / L/C / Other 勾选 T/T 电汇 / L/C 信用证 / 其他\n21,Insurance 保险,\"Tick Seller / Buyer, 110% of invoice value against all risks & war risk 勾选卖方/买方，按发票金额110%投保一切险及战争险\"\n22,Other Terms 其他条款,Optional 可留空\n23,Seller Signature & Seal + Date 卖方签字盖章+日期,\n24,Buyer Signature & Seal + Date 买方签字盖章+日期,\n,,\n\"Note: Clauses 8–10 & 12 (quality/quantity discrepancy, force majeure, arbitration, validity) are fixed text — no fill needed. 注：第 8–10、12 条（质量/数量异议、不可抗力、仲裁、合同生效）为固定条款，无需填写。\",,",
